My workday already ends at two o'clock today.
I pack my laptop into the backpack.
I walk out of the office building.
I immediately open my umbrella.
It is freezing cold.
It will definitely rain in a moment.
But it is not raining.
The thick clouds break apart.
The sky is suddenly blue.
Jonas is right.
The weather forecast is correct.
It will be sunny today.
The sun comes out.
The light is wonderfully bright.
I want to enjoy the great weather.
I am not going to the U-Bahn today.
I prefer to walk to a nearby canal.
